                <pb facs="0565" n="379" sameAs="frus:frus1945Berlinv02/pg379"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#small-caps">Editor’s Note</hi></head>
                <p>—No record of this conversation has been found other than Truman’s statement at the Ninth Plenary
                    Meeting, <pb facs="0566" n="380" xml:id="pg380"/> July 25, “that the Secretary
                    of State had talked with the Poles and expected to have more talks” (see <hi
                        rendition="#italic">post</hi>, <ref target="#pg382">page 382</ref>). Cf.
                        Truman, <hi rendition="#italic">Year
                        of Decisions</hi>, page 388.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
